			description: [
				"&6🚀 Mission Prep: Launch Protocol&r"
				""
				"Before you can set foot on the &fMoon&r, you must prepare for the &ccruel reality of space&r. The void offers no second chances—only those who plan ahead will survive."
				""
				"To begin your cosmic journey, you’ll need:"
				""
				"- A fully assembled &6Tier 1 Rocket&r  "
				"- Enough &bFuel&r to escape the atmosphere  "
				"- A functioning &3Oxygen System&r to keep you breathing"
				""
				"Gather your supplies, refine your engineering, and ensure every piece is in place—&lthere’s no turning back once you hit launch.&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Learn how to build your rocket and more in the  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Tier 1 Rocket Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0A1C7563FC03C5F6\" } }"
