		{
			dependencies: ["6977AFD24DE103EE"]
			description: [
				"&b🌬 Prepare Your Oxygen Supply&r"
				""
				"A space suit might shield you from the vacuum, but without &9oxygen&r, your mission ends before it begins. Survival in the stars requires more than armor—it demands &lifesupport&r."
				""
				"To thrive on the &fMoon&r and beyond, you’ll need to set up &lAd Astra’s&r oxygen infrastructure. Use &aOxygen Loaders&r to fill your suit’s tanks, and place &aOxygen Distributors&r to create breathable pockets within your lunar outposts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Build your system, power it up, and test your oxygen flow. Only then will you be truly &lready for liftoff&r."
				""
				"The void won’t wait—&fsecure your air&r before you soar. 🌌"
