			description: [
				"&f🌕 First Steps on the Moon&r"
				""
				"&lYou did it!&r You’ve shattered the bounds of Earth’s sky and landed upon the silent, cratered surface of the &fMoon&r."
				""
				"The terrain is alien—&7low gravity&r, &7no atmosphere&r, and &7dangers hiding in the dust&r. With each step, you etch your legacy into the lunar soil, but survival won't wait."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
