		{
			dependencies: ["576F413F0C3117B1"]
			description: [
				"&f🌑 Relics of a Forgotten Moon&r"
				""
				"The Moon may appear desolate, but its silence hides the echoes of a bygone age. Scattered across its dusty plains lie &7Ancient Factories&r and &7derelict Pipelines&r—remnants of a once-thriving lunar civilization."
				""
				"These structures aren't just ruins—they’re &6gateways to rare technology&r and &6valuable loot&r. Explore carefully; the Moon guards its secrets well."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Whether you're delving into a &cMoon Dungeon&r, breaching an &eAncient Factory&r, or navigating the &bPipeline systems&r, expect &cdanger at every turn&r. Guardians, traps, and hostile forces lie in wait for the unprepared."
				""
				"&lWill you uncover lost knowledge or be buried with it?&r The Moon's mysteries are yours to claim—if you survive. 🌘🔧"
			]
