		{
			dependencies: ["229BA6C2D9B46694"]
			description: [
				"&f🌒 Lunar Riches Await&r"
				""
				"The Moon isn’t just a stepping stone—it’s a treasure trove of &6exclusive resources&r vital to your progression in space and automation."
				""
				"Deep within the lunar surface, you’ll discover &eAubrum&r—an ore found only in &cMolten Vents&r across the Moon’s terrain. This material is crucial for crafting &ladvanced machinery&r and powering your interplanetary ambitions."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"But Aubrum isn’t the only lunar gem. &bMoon Ice&r can be harvested for water, which is essential for &aoxygen generation&r and even used in producing &9Cryo Fuel&r to power your future rockets."
				""
				"And don’t forget the rare &eCheese Ore&r—it might not fuel machines, but it’s a cosmic delicacy worth collecting just for the laughs. 🧀🌕"
				""
				"&lThe Moon offers more than mystery—it offers opportunity. Mine wisely, survive the elements, and turn lunar stone into starlit progress! 🚀"
			]
