		{
			dependencies: ["45077F865A2C8C02"]
			description: [
				"&f🚀 Next Stop: The Red Frontier&r"
				""
				"Your time on the Moon has taught you how to survive in space, gather rare materials, and build a foothold beyond the Overworld. But this is only the beginning."
				""
				"Armed with &6lunar knowledge&r and &evaluable resources&r like Aubrum and Moon Ice, you're now ready to set your sights on the &4Red Planet&r. Mars presents new biomes, brutal conditions, and thrilling challenges that will push your ingenuity even further."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The path to Mars demands preparation—craft new fuel, reinforce your equipment, and brace for a world both harsh and full of potential."
				""
				"&lYour space journey continues—read more about conquering Mars in its&r  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6169F8EB0E600750\" } }"
