			dependencies: ["2F4C788DE0133300"]
			description: [
				"☀ &cWelcome to Mercury&r"
				""
				"You’ve conquered space, donned the &lNetherite Space Suit&r, and now stand upon the sun-scorched soil of Mercury. This world is a relentless furnace—&cthere is no shade, no softness, only fire and stone&r. The blazing sun dominates the sky, and the landscape offers no comfort."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Unlike the Moon or Mars, Mercury yields no ores—&oit gives nothing for free&r. Every step forward here is earned through resilience and preparation."
				""
				"Before venturing into the planet’s infernal heart, check your &boxygen supply&r, &ffortify your gear&r, and &esurvey the terrain&r. Because ahead lies your next trial:"
				""
				"🔥 &lThe Burning Arena&r—where only the strongest emerge victorious."
				""
				"Are you ready to step into the flame?"
